    "Already ComfyUI-compatible (not the fal format). Nothing to convert - it should load in ComfyUI directly.": "已兼容 ComfyUI（非 fal 格式）。无需转换 — 可直接在 ComfyUI 中加载。",
    "Trigger words": "触发词",
