    "preview": "预览",
    "Set Pixaroma": "设置为 Pixaroma",
    "Home": "首页",
    "🚀 Start here": "🚀 从这里开始",
    "🎨 Editors": "🎨 编辑器",
    "🖼️ Image": "🖼️ 图像",
    "✂️ Resize & Crop": "✂️ 调整大小与裁剪",
    "Image Crop Pixaroma": "图像裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Image Resize Pixaroma": "图像调整大小 Pixaroma",
    "Image Uncrop Pixaroma": "图像反向裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Inpaint Crop Pixaroma": "重绘裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "Inpaint Stitch Pixaroma": "重绘拼接 Pixaroma",
    "Outpaint Pixaroma": "外绘 Pixaroma",
    "Outpaint Stitch Pixaroma": "外绘拼接 Pixaroma",
    "Resize Crop Pixaroma": "调整大小并裁剪 Pixaroma",
    "💬 Prompt & Text": "💬 提示词与文本",
    "📝 Notes & Overlay": "📝 注释与叠加",
    "🔢 Values": "🔢 数值",
    "🔀 Logic & Flow": "🔀 逻辑与流程",
    "🧰 Utility": "🧰 工具",
    "✨ Canvas tools": "✨ 画布工具",
    "Crop any image visually with a draggable handle - no typing pixel coordinates.": "通过拖拽手柄直观裁剪任意图像 — 无需手动输入像素坐标。",
    "+ Add to canvas": "+ 添加到画布",
    "Copy as text": "复制为文本",
    "What it does": "功能说明",
    "Three ways to load a source image: wire any upstream IMAGE into the input slot, drag and drop a file onto the node body, or paste from the clipboard with Ctrl+V. Drag-drop and paste auto-disconnect the upstream wire so your loaded image takes over.": "加载源图像有三种方式：将上游任意 IMAGE 连接至输入槽、将文件拖放到节点主体上、或使用 Ctrl+V 从剪贴板粘贴。拖放和粘贴会自动断开上游连线，以便使用您加载的图像。",
    "How to use": "使用方法",
    "Wire an upstream IMAGE, drag a file onto the node, or paste with Ctrl+V。": "连接上游 IMAGE、将文件拖到节点上、或使用 Ctrl+V 粘贴。",
    "Adjust the crop rectangle using the panel fields or click Open Crop Editor for the fullscreen editor with handles.": "使用面板字段调整裁剪矩形，或点击“打开裁剪编辑器”以使用带拖拽手柄的全屏编辑器。",
    "Run the workflow to output the cropped result.": "运行工作流以输出裁剪结果。",
    "To put an edited crop back later, wire the crop_info output into Image Uncrop Pixaroma.": "如需将编辑后的裁剪内容放回原图，请将 crop_info 输出连接到 Image Uncrop Pixaroma。",
    "The cropped image.": "裁剪后的图像。",
    "The cropped mask, cut with the same box as the image. Wire a MASK in (such as Load Image's MASK) to carry transparency through the crop; otherwise it is a fully-opaque mask sized to the crop.": "裁剪后的蒙版，与图像使用相同的裁剪框。连接 MASK 输入（例如 Load Image 的 MASK 输出）可在裁剪时保留透明度；否则将生成一个与裁剪区域大小一致的不透明蒙版。",
    "crop_info": "裁剪信息",
    "Feed this into Image Uncrop Pixaroma to paste an edited version of the crop back onto the original image at the exact same spot.": "将此输出连接到 Image Uncrop Pixaroma，可将编辑后的裁剪内容精确粘贴回原图像的相同位置。",
    "Width of the cropped area in pixels.": "裁剪区域的宽度（像素）。",
    "Height of the cropped area in pixels.": "裁剪区域的高度（像素）。",
    "What you wire in": "输入说明",
    "Wire any upstream IMAGE here to crop it (Load Image, VAE Decode, ControlNet output, anything). You can also drag-drop an image file onto the node body or paste one with Ctrl+V - those load the image directly and disconnect this wire.": "在此连接任意上游 IMAGE 以进行裁剪（如 Load Image、VAE Decode、ControlNet 输出等）。您也可以将图像文件拖放到节点主体上，或使用 Ctrl+V 粘贴 — 这些操作将直接加载图像并断开此连线。",
    "Optional. Wire a MASK here (for example Load Image's MASK output) to crop the transparency with the exact same box as the image - the result comes out the 'mask' output. Leave it unwired and the mask output is a fully-opaque mask sized to the crop (unless the loaded file itself has transparency, which is used automatically).": "可选。在此连接 MASK（例如 Load Image 的 MASK 输出），可使用与图像完全相同的裁剪框来裁剪透明度 — 结果将输出到“mask”输出端。如不连接，则 mask 输出为与裁剪区域大小一致的不透明蒙版（除非加载的文件本身包含透明度，则会自动使用）。",
    "Start here": "从这里开始",
    "Keeping the nodes up to date, opening a downloaded workflow, the fix for most “it looks broken” reports, and where to ask when none of that helps.": "保持节点更新、打开下载的工作流、修复大多数“看起来坏了”的问题，以及当以上均无效时该去哪里寻求帮助。",
    "Update the nodes": "更新节点",
    "Three ways to get the newest version, in the order to try them.": "按尝试顺序排列的三种获取最新版本的方式。",
    "Run a downloaded workflow": "运行下载的工作流",
    "Two ways to open a workflow file you downloaded.": "两种打开已下载工作流文件的方式。",
    "Buttons or nodes missing?": "按钮或节点缺失？",
    "Almost always the browser cache. Here is the five second fix.": "几乎总是浏览器缓存所致。以下是五秒修复方法。",
    "Need help?": "需要帮助？",
    "Where to ask, and what to include so you get an answer quickly.": "在哪里提问，以及应包含哪些信息以便快速获得解答。",
    "Browse everything": "浏览全部",
    "drag a node card onto the canvas to place it": "将节点卡片拖到画布上以放置",
    "Group Switch Pixaroma": "群组开关 Pixaroma",
    "On/off switches for your Pixaroma Groups, in one small panel.": "在一个小面板中为您的 Pixaroma 群组提供开关控制。",
    "Logic & Flow": "逻辑与流程",
    "Run Log Pixaroma": "运行日志 Pixaroma",
    "Keeps the last 10 run times for this workflow on the canvas.": "在画布上保留此工作流最近 10 次的运行时间。",
    "Control Panel Pixaroma": "控制面板 Pixaroma",
    "Every dial and switch you care about, gathered into one panel that drives your whole workflow.": "将所有您关心的旋钮和开关集中到一个面板中，驱动整个工作流。",
    "Run Timer Pixaroma": "运行计时器 Pixaroma",
    "Times how long a workflow takes, and chimes when it is done.": "计时工作流运行时长，并在完成时发出提示音。",
    "Load Image Mini Pixaroma": "加载图像迷你版 Pixaroma",
    "A compact Load Image: upload, pick, preview, and just two outputs. All the resize controls tuck into the gear.": "紧凑型加载图像节点：上传、选择、预览，仅两个输出。所有调整大小控件都收纳在齿轮设置中。",
    "Image Info Pixaroma": "图像信息 Pixaroma",
    "Unpacks the image_info bundle from Load Image Mini into the mask, size and filename you need.": "从 Load Image Mini 解包 image_info 数据，提取所需的蒙版、尺寸和文件名。",
    "Add a solid-colour border around your image so an outpainting model can paint new scenery into it.": "在图像周围添加纯色边框，以便外绘模型可以在其中绘制新场景。",
    "Resize & Crop": "调整大小与裁剪",
    "Put your pristine original back onto an outpaint result, keeping only the newly generated area.": "将原始图像放回外绘结果中，仅保留新生成的区域。",
    "Seed Pixaroma": "随机种子 Pixaroma",
    "A seed source with one-click random and fixed control - wire it into any sampler's seed input.": "一键随机和固定控制的种子源 — 可连接到任何采样器的种子输入。",
    "Loop Start Pixaroma": "循环开始 Pixaroma",
    "The opening bracket of a loop - repeat a section of your workflow a set number of times.": "循环的开始括号 — 将工作流的一部分重复设定的次数。",
    "Loop End Pixaroma": "循环结束 Pixaroma",
    "The closing bracket of a loop - sends each round back around, then outputs the final result.": "循环的结束括号 — 将每一轮送回重新执行，然后输出最终结果。",
    "Combine Pixaroma": "合并 Pixaroma",
    "Join two inputs into one batch - images, video frames, latents, numbers, or text.": "将两个输入合并为一个批次 — 图像、视频帧、潜变量、数字或文本。",
    "3D Builder Pixaroma": "3D 构建器 Pixaroma",
    "A full 3D scene editor inside ComfyUI - build, light, and render scenes without leaving your workflow.": "ComfyUI 内置的全功能 3D 场景编辑器 — 无需离开工作流即可构建、布光和渲染场景。",
    "Paint Pixaroma": "绘画 Pixaroma",
    "A layered painting editor inside ComfyUI - draw, retouch, and compose on stacked layers.": "ComfyUI 内置的分层绘画编辑器 — 在叠层上绘画、修饰和合成。",
    "Image Composer Pixaroma": "图像合成器 Pixaroma",
    "A layer-based image compositor inside ComfyUI - arrange, blend, and grade multiple images on one canvas.": "ComfyUI 内置的基于图层的图像合成器 — 在一个画布上排列、混合和调色多张图像。",
    "Paste an edited crop back onto the original image at the exact spot it came from.": "将编辑后的裁剪内容精确粘贴回原图像的相同位置。",
    "The easy way to set up an inpaint - paint a mask, get a model-ready crop automatically.": "设置重绘的简便方法 — 绘制蒙版，自动获得模型就绪的裁剪区域。",
    "Paste your inpainted crop back onto the original, blended so the seam disappears.": "将重绘后的裁剪内容放回原图，经过混合使接缝消失。",
    "AudioReact Pixaroma": "音频反应 Pixaroma",
    "Turn a still image into an audio-reactive video - motion and effects that move with the beat.": "将静态图像转换为音频反应视频 — 随节拍运动的动态和特效。",
    "Note Pixaroma": "注释 Pixaroma",
    "A rich-text annotation that lives on your canvas - no wires, no outputs.": "画布上的富文本注释 — 无需连线，无输出。",
    "Notes & Overlay": "注释与叠加",
    "Prompt Multi Pixaroma": "多提示词 Pixaroma",
    "A prompt library with two run modes - queue one image per prompt, or send all prompts as a list.": "具有两种运行模式的提示词库 — 每个提示词排队生成一张图像，或将所有提示词作为列表发送。",
    "Prompt & Text": "提示词与文本",
    "Prompt Pack Pixaroma": "提示词包 Pixaroma",
    "Paste a block of prompts and queue one workflow run per prompt automatically.": "粘贴一组提示词，自动为每个提示词排队运行一次工作流。",
    "Prompt Stack Pixaroma": "提示词堆栈 Pixaroma",
    "Build one combined prompt from a list of toggleable chunks.": "从一组可开关的片段构建一个组合提示词。",
    "Prompt From List Pixaroma": "从列表取提示词 Pixaroma",
    "Picks one prompt by number from a Prompt Multi list.": "从 Prompt Multi 列表中按编号选取一个提示词。",
    "Show Text Pixaroma": "显示文本 Pixaroma",
    "Inspect anything flowing through your workflow - images, prompts, numbers - in a readable text box.": "在可读文本框中检查工作流中的任何内容 — 图像、提示词、数字。",
    "Prompt Reader Pixaroma": "提示词读取器 Pixaroma",
    "Pull the positive prompt saved inside any ComfyUI or Automatic1111 PNG back out as usable text.": "提取保存在任何 ComfyUI 或 Automatic1111 PNG 中的正向提示词，作为可用文本输出。",
    "Load Image Pixaroma": "加载图像 Pixaroma",
    "Load an image with built-in resize - max megapixels, longest side, fit inside, crop to fill, and more - in one node.": "在一个节点中加载图像并内置调整大小功能 — 最大百万像素、最长边、适配内部、裁剪填充等。",
    "Save Image Pixaroma": "保存图像 Pixaroma",
    "Save images to any folder on your computer, with a live preview of the exact filename.": "将图像保存到计算机上的任意文件夹，并实时预览确切文件名。",
    "Load Images from Folder Pixaroma": "从文件夹加载图像 Pixaroma",
    "Load many images from any folder and run your workflow on each one, one at a time.": "从任意文件夹加载多张图像，逐张对每张图像运行工作流。",
    "Preview Image Pixaroma": "预览图像 Pixaroma",
    "Inline image preview with Save, Copy, and Open buttons - batch-aware, with a Strip or Grid layout.": "内联图像预览，带有保存、复制和打开按钮 — 支持批处理，提供条状或网格布局。",
    "Save Mp4 Pixaroma": "保存 MP4 Pixaroma",
    "Encode a frame batch to an H.264 mp4 with optional audio, and watch it play right on the node.": "将帧批次编码为带可选音频的 H.264 MP4，并在节点上直接播放预览。",
    "Load Video Pixaroma": "加载视频 Pixaroma",
    "Upload or pick a video, decode it to frames plus audio and info, and preview it right on the node.": "上传或选择视频，解码为帧序列及音频和信息，并在节点上直接预览。",
    "Load Video Frame Pixaroma": "加载视频帧 Pixaroma",
    "Load a video and pick one exact frame to use as an image. Like a Load Image node, but for video.": "加载视频并选择一帧精确画面用作图像。类似于 Load Image 节点，但用于视频。",
    "Resize an image (and its mask) mid-workflow using a set of smart resize modes.": "在工作流中间使用一组智能调整大小模式调整图像（及其蒙版）的尺寸。",
    "Force an image to an exact width and height by crop-to-fill - no stretching, no letterboxing.": "通过裁剪填充将图像强制调整为精确的宽度和高度 — 无拉伸，无黑边。",
    "Portrait Landscape Pixaroma": "纵向横向切换 Pixaroma",
    "Flip a width and height between portrait (tall) and landscape (wide) with one click.": "一键在纵向（高）和横向（宽）之间切换宽度和高度。",
    "Remove Background Pixaroma": "移除背景 Pixaroma",
    "Cut out the foreground from an image using a BiRefNet AI model.": "使用 BiRefNet AI 模型从图像中抠出前景。",
    "Pause Image Pixaroma": "暂停图像 Pixaroma",
    "Pause your workflow mid-run to review an image before the expensive part runs.": "在工作流运行中途暂停，在耗时部分运行前预览图像。",
    "Pause Text Pixaroma": "暂停文本 Pixaroma",
    "Pause your workflow to read and fix a piece of text before the rest runs.": "暂停工作流，在继续运行前阅读并修正一段文本。",
    "Switch Pixaroma": "开关 Pixaroma",
    "Route one of many wired inputs to a single output by clicking a row.": "通过点击一行，将多个已连线输入之一路由到单个输出。",
    "Switch WH Pixaroma": "宽高开关 Pixaroma",
    "Toggle between two width/height pairs with one click.": "一键在两组宽高对之间切换。",
    "Switch Source Pixaroma": "信号源开关 Pixaroma",
    "Flip a whole set of wires between two setups (A and B) with one toggle.": "通过一个开关在两组设置（A 和 B）之间切换整组连线。",
    "Mute Switch Pixaroma": "静音开关 Pixaroma",
    "Toggle whole workflow branches on and off with per-scene pills.": "通过场景按钮开关整个工作流分支。",
    "Resolution Pixaroma": "分辨率 Pixaroma",
    "One-click resolution picker for AI image sizes, with ratio chips, snap, custom ratios, and math.": "一键分辨率选择器，适用于 AI 图像尺寸，包含比例标签、吸附、自定义比例和计算功能。",
    "Number Pixaroma": "数字 Pixaroma",
    "One number field that outputs the same value as both INT and FLOAT.": "一个数字字段，同时输出 INT 和 FLOAT 两种格式的相同值。",
    "WH Pixaroma": "宽高 Pixaroma",
    "Two number fields for width and height, passed straight through as outputs.": "宽度和高度的两个数字字段，直接作为输出传递。",
    "Text Overlay Pixaroma": "文本叠加 Pixaroma",
    "Adds a styled text layer on top of an image, with a fullscreen editor for precise placement.": "在图像上方添加带样式的文字图层，并提供全屏编辑器以精确定位。",
    "Text Watermark Pixaroma": "文字水印 Pixaroma",
    "Stamps a styled text watermark at a fixed anchor on every image in a batch.": "在批次中每张图像的固定锚点位置添加带样式的文字水印。",
    "Notify Pixaroma": "通知 Pixaroma",
    "Plays a sound when the workflow reaches this node, and times how long the run took to get there.": "当工作流到达此节点时播放提示音，并计时运行至此所花费的时间。",
    "Version Check Pixaroma": "版本检查 Pixaroma",
    "Shows your ComfyUI, frontend, node renderer, and Pixaroma version numbers in one place.": "在一个位置显示您的 ComfyUI、前端、节点渲染器和 Pixaroma 版本号。",
    "Sizes Pixaroma": "尺寸预设 Pixaroma",
    "Your own list of favourite resolutions, with a one-click orientation flip.": "您自己的常用分辨率列表，附带一键方向翻转功能。",
    "Text Join Two Pixaroma": "文本连接二 Pixaroma",
    "Join two pieces of text into one (type or wire each).": "将两段文本连接为一段（可分别输入或连线）。",
    "Text Join Three Pixaroma": "文本连接三 Pixaroma",
    "Join three pieces of text into one (type or wire each).": "将三段文本连接为一段（可分别输入或连线）。",
    "Text Join Four Pixaroma": "文本连接四 Pixaroma",
    "Join four pieces of text into one (type or wire each).": "将四段文本连接为一段（可分别输入或连线）。",
    "Find and Replace Pixaroma": "查找替换 Pixaroma",
